---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='理念 · Ethos · wo/men in tech'
  description='鼓励表达创作 · 深度沟通 · 尊重专业性——这就是 women in tech。'
  width='reading'
>
  <article class='ethos'>
    <header class='ethos-head'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>ETHOS</span>
      <h1 lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>理念</h1>
      <h1 lang='en' class='lang-en'>Ethos</h1>
      <p class='value'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>鼓励表达创作 · 深度沟通 · 尊重专业性——这就是 women in tech。</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Encourage expression · Deep dialogue · Respect for craft—<br />that is what women in tech means.</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='manifesto'>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>在每一个商业项目的空隙里，<br />总有一些东西是做给自己的。</p>
        <p>这里是那个地方。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>In between every commercial sprint,<br />there is always something we build for ourselves.</p>
        <p>This is that sanctuary.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='who'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>面向群体</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Crafted For</span>
      </span>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>所有在技术与创造领域工作的女性——产品、设计、工程、研究、写作……</p>
        <p class='quiet'>不需要特定头衔，<br />只是对作品本身有一点执念。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>All women creating across tech and design—product, design, engineering, research, writing…</p>
        <p class='quiet'>No specific titles required,<br />only a quiet devotion to the craft itself.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='principles'>
      <p lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>真诚平等 · 低压倾听 · 保护留白 · 慢工署名</p>
      <p lang='en' class='lang-en'>Grounded · Low-pressure · White space · Authored craft</p>
    </section>

    <nav class='ethos-nav'>
      <a href='/events'>机制</a>
      <a href='/upcoming'>排期</a>
      <a href='/join'>加入</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ethos {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-20) 0 var(--spacing-24);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .ethos-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ethos-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .value {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: var(--spacing-2) 0 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .rule {
    display: block;
    width: var(--spacing-8);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .manifesto p,
  .who p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p.quiet { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); font-size: 13.5px; }

  .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .who .eyebrow { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); }

  .principles p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ethos-nav { display: flex; gap: var(--spacing-5); margin-top: var(--spacing-2); }
  .ethos-nav a {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider) !important;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .ethos-nav a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--color-gold-dust) !important; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .ethos { padding: var(--spacing-16) 0 var(--spacing-20); gap: var(--spacing-6); }
    .ethos-head h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .value { font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
